# Error

Result/Option helpers, written in pure LOGOS and compiled through every execution tier.
`Ok`/`Err`/`Some`/`None` are engine-resolved; these functions add the common combinators.
Auto-imported on first reference.

## Note
Returns the value inside an `Ok`, or `fallback` when the result is an `Err`.

## To unwrapOr (r: Result of Int and Text) and (fallback: Int) -> Int:
    Inspect r:
        When Ok (v):
            Return v.
        When Err (e):
            Return fallback.
